                            radius = 20.dp.toPx(),
                        )
                        drawCircle(
                            color = if (color.isUnspecified) surfaceContainer else color,
                            radius = 20.dp.toPx(),
                        )
                    }
                    if (index == 0)
                        Icon(
                            modifier = Modifier.align(Alignment.Center),
                            painter = blockIconId,
                            contentDescription = null
                        )
                }
            }
        }
    }
